Falsifies `non_volatile_memory_express::verification::identify_parse_is_total_and_bounds_the_shift`.

The defect: `parse_identify_namespace` widens the accepted LBA data size from `9..=12` to `9..=13`.
An 8 KiB logical block then reaches `blocks_per(4096)`, which cannot serve it.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!((9..=12).contains(&id.logical_block_address_shift))`.

